Apolo Jolt C++

Native implementation of a subset of the Chainr transformation contract.
Reference: JOLT Community Edition
https://github.com/jolt-community/jolt-community
Reference revision: 401b1df4ec61f6b66e498b28e2d3c67de21274f7
